        },
        {
          "text": "raŋaw talin apar m'oyido ocungo ruwaŋ Kabedo Maleŋ Loyo, abic i thenge ma yupiny kodi abic i thenge ma yumalo, mawuwin, talin, lew gin, ",
          "type": "text",
